  "text_content": "Menu Student Files Classes Instructor Open submenu Reports Open submenu Set Class Schedule School Permits Close submenu Instructor Instructor Schedule Open submenu Instructor Reports Open submenu My Signatures Close submenu Instructor Schedule Booked Appointments Specify Hours Close submenu Instructor Reports Work Summary To Do Lists Close submenu Reports AQTR Registrations Ilan Preisler logout Self-Evaluation of In-Car Session Practical Session #5 Korai, Noor Ul Saba 1. In the Learner's view, what are the strengths and what are the weaknesses to be worked on at this stage of he practical training? I need to learn parking and making proper stops / bling spots check. 2. In the Instructor's view, what are the strengths and what are the weaknesses to be worked on at this stage of he practical training? Student is a good driver. She needs to practice more maintaining speeds in different zones, making proper stops and blind spot checks and practice the two types of parkings we did today. Student Student Signature Korai, Noor Ul Saba Nov 29, 2025 Instructor Instructor Signature Aqib Qureshi Save",
